2. What this repository contains
--------------------------------

This reproduction was produced independently by re-running the authors'
notebooks and analysis scripts. Files fall into two provenance classes:

  [Upstream-derived, MIT]
    - model function modules: functions_param_estim.py,
      functions_model_comp.py, functions_param_estim_s2.py
    - noise kernel: levy_noise.pyx, levy_noise.c, my_setup.py
    - analysis scripts: ttj_analyses.Rmd, ttj_analyses_s2.Rmd
    These are unmodified copies (MD5-identical) or minimally path-adapted
    copies of the upstream code. MIT terms apply.

  [Reproduction output, produced in this repository]
    - executed notebooks: *.executed.ipynb
    - parameter estimates: estimates_*/estimates_*.csv
    - posterior-predictive simulations, if included: simulates_*.csv
    - figures: figures/*.png, 1_moni/*.png
    - rendered reports: ttj_analyses*.html
    - run logs: _step*.log, _alpha_run.log
    - trace scripts: _insert_seed*.py, _fix_*.py, _extract_*.py
    - Chinese summaries: 结论_中文.md, 数值核对表.md

  Note: outputs derived from the authors' empirical data or from their
  trained networks carry the upstream CC BY 4.0 attribution requirement.
  Where estimates/figures are derived from upstream data or checkpoints,
  they are distributed under CC BY 4.0 with the attribution above.


