4. Reproduction-specific disclosure
-----------------------------------

  - This reproduction loads the authors' pre-trained BayesFlow checkpoints
    and performs inference only; it does NOT retrain the 250-epoch networks.
  - A fixed random seed (42) was inserted to make inference reproducible.
  - No model parameters, priors, or simulation functions were altered;
    only environment/path adaptations and loss-plot safeguards were applied.
  - See README.md and each module's 结论_中文.md for the full change log.


